title: "LeanVerifier"
message: "If you use LeanVerifier, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Petel
    given-names: "Matéo H."
repository-code: "https://github.com/fraware/leanverifier"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-24"
abstract: >-
  Technical preview of exact formal checks for affine binary classifiers over
  rationals, with an L-infinity margin-robustness theorem, deterministic
  generator, and isolated CLI verify path. Not a general ML verification product.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - robustness
  - affine classifiers
  - L-infinity
